Cell["HyperCrown boundary x11 = 0", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3a77761e-48f7-4d28-a592-664d9251b69f"],

Cell["\<\
This is the current positive HyperCrown boundary example. It is an ordinary \
wide-angle HRF run on the native restricted F0, with no asymptotic-order \
alignment. The WideAngle4ptBoundary preset first identifies cancellation \
generators and the FSL+FObs decomposition; exact coverage then determines the \
scaling.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b2822321-b08a-4d05-922a-be88e64aae79"],

